// duel_25v25's HealPulse — single-target ally healing for chronicle-
// pipeline recovery dynamics in 50-agent combat.
//
// Lowers to AbilityProgram { gate: { cooldown_ticks: 0, hostile_only: false },
//                            area: SingleTarget { range: 1.5 },
//                            effects: [EffectOp::Heal { amount: 15.0 }] }.
//
// `target: ally` semantic (the .sim's body-side check inverts the team
// test, dispatching on same-team agents); the lowering pass sets
// `hostile_only = false` for ally targeting.

ability HealPulse {
    target: ally
    range: 1.5
    cooldown: 0

    heal 15
}
